description:
**Files:** `dashboard/src/components/policy/SnapshotComparison.tsx`, `dashboard/src/api/types.ts`, `dashboard/src/api/transform.ts`

**Problem:** 5 TypeScript errors + runtime bugs:

1. **Line 8** (TS2724): Imports `type PolicySnapshot` from `../../hooks/usePolicies` but `usePolicies.ts` doesn't re-export the type. Fix: import from `../../api/types` instead.

2. **Lines 190-191** (TS2339 x4): Accesses `.rules` on `PolicySnapshot` but property doesn't exist. Backend snapshots store rules nested inside `bundles` map (each bundle is YAML with rules inside).

3. **Line 147** (runtime): Accesses `s.version` and `s.createdBy` which don't exist on `PolicySnapshot` type or backend response — always renders "undefined".

**Fix (3 files):**

(a) `api/types.ts`: Add fields to `PolicySnapshot`:
```typescript
export interface PolicySnapshot extends PolicySnapshotSummary {
  bundles?: Record<string, unknown>;
  version?: number;
  createdBy?: string;
  rules?: PolicyRule[];
}
```

(b) `api/transform.ts`: Update `mapPolicySnapshot` to extract `rules` from bundles' content. Each bundle in the `bundles` map has a YAML-parsed `rules` array. Flatten all bundle rules into the snapshot's `rules` field. Derive `version` from snapshot order index if not available.

(c) `SnapshotComparison.tsx`: Fix import to `../../api/types`. Add fallbacks: `v{s.version ?? '?'}` and `{s.createdBy ?? 'system'}`.

implementationPlan.description:
Update `dashboard/src/api/types.ts` — add `version`, `createdBy`, and `rules` fields to `PolicySnapshot`:
```typescript
export interface PolicySnapshot extends PolicySnapshotSummary {
  bundles?: Record<string, unknown>;
  version?: number;
  createdBy?: string;
  rules?: PolicyRule[];
}
```
Import `PolicyRule` if not already imported at the top of the file (it should already be defined in the same file).

Update `dashboard/src/api/transform.ts` — enhance `BackendPolicySnapshot` and `mapPolicySnapshot`:

(a) Add fields to `BackendPolicySnapshot`:
```typescript
export interface BackendPolicySnapshot extends BackendPolicySnapshotSummary {
  bundles?: Record<string, unknown>;
  version?: number;
  created_by?: string;
}
```

(b) Update `mapPolicySnapshot` to extract rules from bundles and map new fields:
```typescript
export function mapPolicySnapshot(snapshot: BackendPolicySnapshot): PolicySnapshot {
  // Extract rules from all bundles
  const rules: PolicyRule[] = [];
  if (snapshot.bundles) {
    for (const bundle of Object.values(snapshot.bundles)) {
      const b = bundle as Record<string, unknown>;
      const bundleRules = b?.rules ?? (b?.content as Record<string, unknown>)?.rules;
      if (Array.isArray(bundleRules)) {
        for (const r of bundleRules) {
          rules.push(mapPolicyRule(r as Record<string, unknown>));
        }
      }
    }
  }
  return {
    id: snapshot.id,
    createdAt: snapshot.created_at || "",
    note: snapshot.note,
    bundles: snapshot.bundles,
    version: snapshot.version,
    createdBy: snapshot.created_by,
    rules: rules.length > 0 ? rules : undefined,
  };
}
```
Import `PolicyRule` from types and `mapPolicyRule` (already exists in the file).

Fix `dashboard/src/components/policy/SnapshotComparison.tsx`:

(a) Line 8: Change import source from `../../hooks/usePolicies` to import `PolicySnapshot` from `../../api/types`:
```typescript
import {
  usePolicySnapshots,
  usePolicySnapshot,
} from "../../hooks/usePolicies";
import type { PolicySnapshot } from "../../api/types";
```

(b) Line 147: Add fallbacks for `s.version` and `s.createdBy`:
```typescript
<option key={s.id} value={s.id}>
  v{s.version ?? '?'} — {new Date(s.createdAt).toLocaleDateString()} by {s.createdBy ?? 'system'}
</option>
```
